Its release archive, wasmkeep-c-sdk-<version>.tar.gz, also contains:

- wit/, a copy of crates/wasmkeep-wit/wit in the WasmKeep repository. The
  WASI interface files in wit/deps/ are Copyright the Contributors to the
  WASI Specification, published by the WebAssembly Community Group under
  the W3C Community Contributor License Agreement.
- gen/, the C bindings generated from wit/ by wit-bindgen for the `actor`
  world (actor.h, actor.c, actor_component_type.o), which carry the
  documentation comments of those files.
- scripts/componentize-core.sh, from the WasmKeep repository (Apache
  License, Version 2.0). On its first run it downloads the WASI 0.1
  adapter from crates.io; the adapter is not in the archive and comes
  under its own license.
